      "body": "\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nto fix UT issue [3129](https://jira.devtools.intel.com/browse/VLLMZ-3129)\r\n\r\nIt register the FLASH_ATTN_MLA backend enum to the implementation class XPUFlashAttnMLABackend.\r\n\r\nAfter enabled FLASH_ATTN_MLA on XPU, where XPUPlatform selects XPUFlashAttnMLABackend. test_mla_backends.py resolves backends with AttentionBackendEnum.get_class(), which returns the CUDA FlashAttnMLABackend, so on XPU it ran the CUDA implementation and cases failed. Registering the XPU class lets this test run the right backend on XPU. \r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n`pytest -v -s tests/v1/attention/test_mla_backends.py`\r\n\r\n## Test result\r\nBefore this pr:\r\n`error like:\r\nFailed: 1 backend(s) failed: AttentionBackendEnum.FLASH_ATTN_MLA`\r\n\r\nAfter this pr:\r\n`627 passed, 6 skipped, 16 warnings in 869.29s`\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
